$DATUM Attempts for the cyclization of 26 To a solution of 26 (5.0 mg, 0.011
mmol) in CH2Cl2 (4 mL) was added 1st Grubbs cat. (0.7 mg, 0.001 mmol) at
room temperature. The reaction mixture was refluxed for 4 h. After
cooling to room temperature, Florisil® (10 mg) was added. After stirring
at this temperature for 1 h, the reaction mixture was filtered through a
Celite® pad (washed with CH2Cl2). The filtrate was concentrated in vacuo,
the residue was purified by PTLC (silica gel, hexane/EtOAc=2/1).
Byproduct S11 (3.6 mg, ca. 75%) as a colorless oil with some impurities.
Rf 0.30 (hexane/EtOAc = 2/1); 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.53- 1.59 (m,
2H), 1.99- 2.09 (m, 2H), 2.12- 2.17 (m, 2H), 2.34 (s, 3H), 4.43 (s, 1H,
OH), 4.95 (d, 1H, J = 10.2 Hz), 4.98 (dd, 1H, J = 17.1, 1.5 Hz), 5.34
(dd, 1H, J = 11.2, 0.8 Hz), 5.69- 5.76 (m, 1H), 5.72 (dd, 1H, J = 17.7,
0.8 Hz), 5.83 (s, 1H), 6.79 (dd, 1H, J = 17.7, 11.2 Hz), 6.86 (t, 1H, J =
7.5 Hz), 6.98 (s, 1H), 7.18 (d, 2H, J = 8.1 Hz), 7.30 (d, 2H, J = 8.1
Hz), 8.73 (s, 1H, OH); 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ 21.4, 27.8, 29.1, 33.0,
115.3, 116.2, 116.6, 118.4, 119.4, 124.4, 127.0, 129.8, 130.7, 136.9,
137.7, 141.6, 144.3, 145.5, 145.6, 149.5; IR (neat) 3255 (br), 2926,
2858, 1457, 1421, 1260, 1196, 1083, 1025, 924, 806 cm-1; [α]D 26- 61 (c
0.11, CHCl3); HRMS (ESI) calcd for C22H24NaO3S ([M+Na]+) m/z 391.1338,
Found m/z 391.1323.
