$DATUM To a stirred solution of compound 5.2 (1eq) in dry DCM was added 15 mol %
Grubbs’ second generation catalyst at room temperature. The reaction
mixture was refluxed for 3 h. The reaction mixture concentrated in vacuo
and purified by flash chromatography. Pure product 5.3.
(2R,3R,3aS,11S,15aS,E)-11-benzyl-2-(((S)-2,2-dimethyl-1,3-dioxolan-4-yl)methyl)-3-methoxy-2,3,3a,4,10,11,15,15a-octahydrofuro[2,3-i][1,6,3]dioxaazacyclotetradecine-9,12(7H,14H)-dione
(5.3a): Purified by flash chromatography using 50% ethyl acetate in
hexane; Yield: 70%. Molecular Formula: C27H37NO8; Rf (50% ethyl
acetate/hexane): 0.3; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm 1.38 (s, 3H), 1.44
(s, 3H), 1.75-1.87 (m, 2H), 1.94 (d, J = 2.4 Hz, 2H), 2.01-2.08 (m, 1H),
2.26-2.44 (m, 2H), 2.94-3.03 (m, 1H), 3.12-3.24 (m, 1H), 3.27 (bs, 1H),
3.34 (s, 3H), 3.60-3.68 (t, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 3.93-3.96 (m, 2H), 4.01-4.11
(m, 2H), 4.22 (q, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.38-4.48 (m, 1H), 4.59-4.67 (d, J =
6.8 Hz, 1H), 4.83-4.92 (q, J = 9.2 Hz, 1H), 4.92-4.99 (m, 1H), 5.54-5.63
(m, 1H), 5.80 (ddd, J = 13.5, 7.0, 3.3 Hz, 1H) 7.20 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H),
7.32-7.45 (m, 3H); 13C NMR(100 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm; 25.7, 27.0, 29.6, 33.3,
36.7, 38.8, 48.5, 55.8, 57.5, 61.6, 64.7, 69.6, 74.1, 79.6, 92.0, 108.5,
127.4, 128.8, 128.9, 135.8, 155.7, 171.4; LRMS: (ES+) m/z = 484 (M+1),
506 (M+23).
