$DATUM (R)-2-((R)-2-((4-Methoxybenzyl)oxy)pent-4-en-1-yl)-3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran
(7). Grubbs second generation catalyst (17 mg, 20 μmol, 5 mol %) was
added to a solution of allyl ether 6 (127 mg, 400 μmol, 1 equiv) in
CH2Cl2 (80 mL) at 40 °C. After 60 min, the solvent was removed in vacuo,
and the residue was subjected to flash chromatography (SiO2,
hexanes:EtOAc, 90:10). Dihydropyran 7 (92 mg, 0.32 mmol) as a brownish
oil in 80% yield. TLC (SiO2). R f = 0.26 (hexanes/EtOAc 95:5). [α]D 25 =
-14 (c 1.0, CHCl3). IR (NaCl, film): 2916, 2834, 1612, 1513, 1384, 1248,
1090, 915, 821 cm-1. 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 1.60-1.66 (m, 2H),
1.93-2.06 (m, 2H), 2.32-2.40 (m, 2H), 3.71-3.76 (m, 1H), 3.79-3.82 (m,
1H), 3.82 (s, 3H), 4.06-4.18 (m, 2H), 4.43 (d, J = 11.1 Hz, 1H), 4.60 (d,
J = 11.1 Hz, 1H), 5.09 (dq, J = 10.4, 0.9 Hz, 1H), 5.13 (dq, J = 17.1,
1.5 Hz, 1H), 5.70-5.75 (m, 1H), 5.79-5.83 (m, 1H), 5.87 (ddt, J = 17.1,
10.0, 7.3 Hz, 1H), 6.88-6.92 (m, 2H), 7.27-7.32 (m, 2H). 13C NMR (62.9
MHz, CDCl3) δ: 31.4, 38.8, 41.1, 55.1, 65.6, 70.0, 71.2, 74.2, 113.6
(2C), 117.1, 124.4, 126.2, 129.4 (2C), 130.9, 134.6, 159.1. HRMS (ESI)
calculated for C18H24O3Na [M + Na]+: 311.1618, found: 311.1646.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM optimization study (optimized on catalyst, loading and temp),
ring-closing metathesis
